{"manifest_version": 2, "name": "WordHunt Overlay \u2014 T\u00ecm t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a \u1ea9n", "version": "1.0", "description": "Ch\u1ecdn ng\u1eabu nhi\u00ean m\u1ed9t t\u1eeb tr\u00ean trang v\u00e0 th\u1eed t\u00ecm. Khi t\u00ecm th\u1ea5y, highlight t\u1ea1m th\u1eddi (kh\u00f4ng s\u1eeda DOM n\u1ed9i dung).", "permissions": ["activeTab", "storage"], "browser_action": {"default_title": "WordHunt", "default_popup": "popup.html"}, "content_scripts": [{"matches": ["<all_urls>"], "js": ["content_script.js"], "css": ["content_style.css"], "run_at": "document_idle"}], "icons": {"48": "icons/icon-48.png"}, "browser_specific_settings": {"gecko": {"id": "wordhunt@example.com", "data_collection_permissions": {"required": ["none"]}}}}